warning[pinned-task]: `@async` pins task and its parent to current thread
 --> positive.jl:2:8
  |
2 | task = @async fetch_data(url)
  |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ sticky task
  |
  = why: pinned task waits for its thread while others idle; parent task stays pinned for its whole life
  = fix: replace `@async` with `Threads.@spawn`   [breaking]
  = docs: corset explain pinned-task
  = note: warn from composability group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow pinned-task -- <reason>`

