warning[pinned-task]: `Task` creates sticky task; `schedule` pins it and caller to one thread
 --> positive.jl:9:12
  |
9 |     task = Task(f)
  |            ^^^^^^^ sticky by default
  |
  = why: sticky task runs only on scheduling thread; scheduling it also pins calling task
  = fix: start task with `Threads.@spawn`, or set `task.sticky = false` before `schedule`   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain pinned-task

