warning[pinned-task]: `Threads.@threads :static` pins one task to each thread
  --> positive.jl:17:18
   |
17 | Threads.@threads :static for i in 1:10
   |                  ^^^^^^^ static schedule
   |
   = why: `:static` throws when caller runs on thread other than 1 or inside another `@threads` loop
   = fix: remove `:static`; keep state per chunk of work, not per `threadid()`   [manual]
   = docs: corset explain pinned-task

